+2.  **Reconstruction:** Approximate the original signal $\tilde{f}(\omega)$ by summing the basis functions weighted by the coefficients:
+    $$ \tilde{f}(\omega) = \sum_{i=1}^{n} f_i y_i(\omega) $$
+    [S1]. The accuracy increases with $n$ [S1].
 
