-    where the transfer matrix elements are defined as [S1]:
-    $$ C_{ijk} = \int_{\Omega} y_i(\omega) y_j(\omega) y_k(\omega) d\omega $$
-    The matrix $C_{ijk}$ is constant for a given bandwidth and can be precomputed [S1].
